@startuml trigger-pipeline
title Trigger Pipeline Sequence

actor User
participant "Next.js Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Next.js Auth Routes" as Auth
participant "Kestra" as Kestra
participant "Groq API" as Groq
participant "X API" as Twitter
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

opt Connect X first
  User -> Frontend: Click Connect X
  Frontend -> Auth: GET /api/auth/twitter
  Auth --> User: Redirect to X OAuth 2.0 consent
  User -> Auth: Return to callback with code
  Auth --> Frontend: Set cookies
end

User -> Frontend: Submit YouTube URL + cookies + dry_run
Frontend -> Kestra: POST /executions/vid2tweet/content-pipeline
note right
FormData includes:
- youtube_url
- youtube_cookies
- dry_run
- twitter_oauth2_token (if cookie exists)
end note
Kestra --> Frontend: executionId

loop every 5s until terminal state
  Frontend -> Kestra: GET /executions/{id}
  Kestra --> Frontend: state + taskRunList + outputs
end

Kestra -> Groq: Transcribe audio
Groq --> Kestra: transcript
Kestra -> Groq: Generate tweet
Groq --> Kestra: tweet text

Kestra --> Frontend: Execution enters PAUSED
Frontend -> Kestra: GET /executions/{id}/file
Kestra --> Frontend: thumbnail / tweet artifacts
Frontend -> User: Show review UI

alt User approves
  User -> Frontend: Approve with optional edits
  Frontend -> Kestra: POST /executions/{id}/resume
  note right
  FormData includes:
  - approved=true
  - edited_tweet?
  end note

  alt dry run
    Kestra -> Kestra: Create mock tweet result
  else OAuth 2.0 token present
    Kestra -> Twitter: POST text tweet
    Twitter --> Kestra: tweet id
  else OAuth 1.0a fallback
    Kestra -> Twitter: Upload thumbnail media
    Twitter --> Kestra: media id
    Kestra -> Twitter: POST tweet with media
    Twitter --> Kestra: tweet id
  end

  Kestra -> DB: INSERT POSTED result
  DB --> Kestra: OK
else User rejects
  User -> Frontend: Reject
  Frontend -> Kestra: POST /executions/{id}/resume
  Kestra -> DB: INSERT REJECTED result
  DB --> Kestra: OK
end

Kestra --> Frontend: SUCCESS
Frontend -> User: Show final status

@enduml
